          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wantoonni bara mootummaa Yerobiʼaam keessa hojjetaman biraa, wanni inni hojjete hundi, jabinni loltummaa isaa, akka inni itti Damaasqoo fi Hamaati kanneen duraan Yihuudaa jala turan sana Israaʼeliif deebisee dabalatee kitaaba seenaa mootota Israaʼel keessatti barreeffamaniiru mitii?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yerobiʼaam abbootii isaa mootota Israaʼel wajjin boqote; ilmi isaa Zakkaariyaas iddoo isaa buʼee mootii taʼe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.29"
            ]
